id: QUAL-072
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: Long method chain (6+ dots — hard to debug)
category: quality
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .jsx .tsx .java .kt .cs
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
patterns:
  - regex: \w+\.\w+\([^)]*\)\.\w+\([^)]*\)\.\w+\([^)]*\)\.\w+\([^)]*\)\.\w+\([^)]*\)\.\w+\(
    message: "6+ chained method calls — hard to debug (which call failed?). Break into intermediate variables."
fix: Break long chains into named intermediates. const filtered = items.filter(...); const sorted = filtered.sort(...).
